# 1. WHILE LOOP (15 Programs)
### 1. Print Numbers from 1 to 10
```python
i = 1
while i <= 10:
    print(i)
    i += 1
```

### 2. Print Numbers from 10 to 1
```python
i = 10
while i >= 1:
    print(i)
    i -= 1
```

### 3. Sum of Numbers from 1 to 10
```python
i = 1
total = 0

while i <= 10:
    total += i
    i += 1

print(total)
```

### 4. Print Even Numbers
